WEBVTT

00:00:00.367 --> 00:00:02.900
Are you a SMART fella,

00:00:02.900 --> 00:00:04.933
or a FART smella?

00:00:04.933 --> 00:00:06.433
Let's find OUT!

00:00:07.600 --> 00:00:08.333
Alright,

00:00:08.333 --> 00:00:10.567
a word analogy!

00:00:10.567 --> 00:00:13.533
Shoe is to foot,

00:00:13.533 --> 00:00:16.467
as hat is to...

00:00:16.467 --> 00:00:17.233
what?

00:00:17.233 --> 00:00:17.967
A.

00:00:17.967 --> 00:00:18.700
Head,

00:00:18.700 --> 00:00:19.433
B.

00:00:19.433 --> 00:00:20.167
Hair,

00:00:20.167 --> 00:00:20.933
C.

00:00:20.933 --> 00:00:21.667
Neck,

00:00:21.667 --> 00:00:23.133
or D.

00:00:23.133 --> 00:00:23.867
Glove?

00:00:23.867 --> 00:00:25.367
Five seconds!

00:00:31.133 --> 00:00:32.333
TIME'S UP!

00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:33.400
It's...

00:00:33.400 --> 00:00:33.800
A,

00:00:33.800 --> 00:00:34.200
head!

00:00:34.200 --> 00:00:36.600
A shoe goes on a foot,

00:00:36.600 --> 00:00:39.000
so a hat goes on a

00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:39.400
head.

00:00:39.400 --> 00:00:41.800
It is the body part each

00:00:41.800 --> 00:00:42.600
one covers.

00:00:43.767 --> 00:00:44.333
Okay,

00:00:44.333 --> 00:00:46.033
a picture puzzle!

00:00:46.033 --> 00:00:49.433
Where does the dot move next?

00:00:49.433 --> 00:00:50.000
A.

00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:50.567
Top-right,

00:00:50.567 --> 00:00:51.133
B.

00:00:51.133 --> 00:00:51.700
Bottom-left,

00:00:51.700 --> 00:00:52.267
C.

00:00:52.267 --> 00:00:52.833
Center,

00:00:52.833 --> 00:00:54.000
or D.

00:00:54.000 --> 00:00:54.567
Top-left?

00:00:54.567 --> 00:00:55.700
Five seconds!

00:01:01.467 --> 00:01:02.667
TIME'S UP!

00:01:03.333 --> 00:01:04.967
The answer is...

00:01:04.967 --> 00:01:05.533
A,

00:01:05.533 --> 00:01:06.067
top-right!

00:01:06.067 --> 00:01:08.267
The dot steps counter-clockwise

00:01:08.267 --> 00:01:09.900
corner to corner:

00:01:09.900 --> 00:01:10.467
top-left,

00:01:10.467 --> 00:01:11.000
bottom-left,

00:01:11.000 --> 00:01:11.567
bottom-right,

00:01:11.567 --> 00:01:14.867
so the next corner is top-right.

00:01:16.000 --> 00:01:16.600
Alright,

00:01:16.600 --> 00:01:18.433
a number analogy!

00:01:18.433 --> 00:01:20.233
One makes four,

00:01:20.233 --> 00:01:22.067
two makes six,

00:01:22.067 --> 00:01:23.867
three makes eight,

00:01:23.867 --> 00:01:25.700
so four makes...

00:01:25.700 --> 00:01:26.300
what?

00:01:26.300 --> 00:01:26.900
A.

00:01:26.900 --> 00:01:27.500
Nine,

00:01:27.500 --> 00:01:28.100
B.

00:01:28.100 --> 00:01:28.733
Ten,

00:01:28.733 --> 00:01:29.333
C.

00:01:29.333 --> 00:01:29.933
Eleven,

00:01:29.933 --> 00:01:31.133
or D.

00:01:31.133 --> 00:01:31.733
Twelve?

00:01:31.733 --> 00:01:32.967
Five seconds!

00:01:38.733 --> 00:01:39.933
TIME'S UP!

00:01:40.600 --> 00:01:41.067
It's...

00:01:41.067 --> 00:01:41.533
B,

00:01:41.533 --> 00:01:42.000
ten!

00:01:42.000 --> 00:01:44.833
Each number is doubled then add

00:01:44.833 --> 00:01:45.300
two:

00:01:45.300 --> 00:01:47.667
four times two is eight,

00:01:47.667 --> 00:01:49.567
plus two is ten.

00:01:50.700 --> 00:01:51.100
So,

00:01:51.100 --> 00:01:53.133
are you smart or fart?

00:01:53.133 --> 00:01:55.567
Count up your correct answers to

00:01:55.567 --> 00:01:56.767
find your rank!

00:01:57.933 --> 00:01:58.267
So,

00:01:58.267 --> 00:01:59.667
how did you do?

00:01:59.667 --> 00:02:01.033
Comment your score below,

00:02:01.033 --> 00:02:02.400
and follow for more!
